ousing-jv-buys-10-acre-land-in-chennai-for-senior-living-project-eyes-rs-1100-cr-revenue/articleshow/136197134.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:21:45 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Market Trading Guide: Tech Mahindra, Angel One among 5 stock recommendations for Friday]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Market experts recommend five stocks for Friday, including Tech Mahindra, Angel One, Tata Consumer, Kansai Nerolac and Agarwal Eye, outlining entry levels, stop losses and upside targets.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/market-trading-guide-tech-mahindra-angel-one-among-5-stock-recommendations-for-friday/slideshow/136196068.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136195984,imgsize-9956.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/market-trading-guide-tech-mahindra-angel-one-among-5-stock-recommendations-for-friday/slideshow/136196068.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:20:06 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[India bonds tumble as Brent tops $95 per barrel, RBI flags food inflation risks]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Indian government bonds experienced a decline as oil prices increased due to geopolitical tensions in the Middle East. The Reserve Bank of India emphasized broad-based food inflation pressures, complicating the economic landscape. Retail inflation had already surpassed the RBI's threshold of 6% in October, prompting concern among economists. Market participants are anticipating the upcoming monetary policy decision on December 4.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/india-bonds-tumble-as-brent-tops-95-per-barrel-rbi-flags-food-inflation-risks/articleshow/136193320.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136193320,imgsize-190570.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/india-bonds-tumble-as-brent-tops-95-per-barrel-rbi-flags-food-inflation-risks/articleshow/136193320.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:41:40 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[NSE among 6 stocks hitting 52-week highs; stock rallies up to 35% in a month]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Six BSE 100 stocks, including NSE, DLF and Prestige Estates, hit fresh 52-week highs on Thursday. NSE led monthly gains, surging 35%, followed by Prestige Estates at 32%.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nse-among-6-stocks-hitting-52-week-highs-stock-rallies-up-to-35-in-a-month/slideshow/136192775.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136191931,imgsize-11832.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nse-among-6-stocks-hitting-52-week-highs-stock-rallies-up-to-35-in-a-month/slideshow/136192775.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:58:07 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Spike in oil prices partly reverses rupee rally, forward premiums surge]]> </title><description><![CDATA[The Indian rupee has faced depreciation as a result of escalating oil prices combined with pressures from surrounding currencies. With Brent crude exceeding $96 per barrel, worries about India's import costs and inflation have intensified. Recent days have seen heightened hedging activity among importers, leading analysts to forecast potential testing of the rupee's support levels. Additionally, banks are urging central bank intervention to manage the growing dollar surplus.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/forex/forex-news/spike-in-oil-prices-partly-reverses-rupee-rally-forward-premiums-surge/articleshow/136188127.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136188127,imgsize-59978.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/forex/forex-news/spike-in-oil-prices-partly-reverses-rupee-rally-forward-premiums-surge/articleshow/136188127.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:06:16 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[HDFC Bank Share Price Live Updates: HDFC Bank Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/hdfc-bank-share-price-live-26-nov-2026/liveblog/136181934.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136181934,imgsize-12884.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/hdfc-bank-share-price-live-26-nov-2026/liveblog/136181934.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:21:53 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[SBI Life Share Price Live Updates: SBI Life Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/sbi-life-stock-price-live-updates-26-nov-2026/liveblog/136181870.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136181870,imgsize-18048.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/sbi-life-stock-price-live-updates-26-nov-2026/liveblog/136181870.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:20:36 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rupee falls 20 paise to 92.40 against US dollar in early trade]]> </title><description><![CDATA[The rupee fell 20 paise to 92.40 against the US dollar in early trade. Higher crude oil prices and proposed tariffs by the US administration increased dollar demand. Foreign fund inflows supported the rupee but it faced pressure from rising crude prices. The US proposed 25 percent tariffs on imports from India, which raised inflation concerns. India rejected these allegations and expressed commitment to finalize a bilateral trade deal.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/forex/rupee-falls-20-paise-to-92-40-against-us-dollar-in-early-trade/articleshow/136179591.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136179591,imgsize-80530.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/forex/rupee-falls-20-paise-to-92-40-against-us-dollar-in-early-trade/articleshow/136179591.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:54:36 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[India bonds tumble as Brent tops $95 per barrel, RBI flags food inflation risks]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Indian government bonds fell as oil prices surged, raising concerns about inflation and economic stability. The Reserve Bank of India highlighted rising food inflation pressures, indicating widespread price increases. Higher oil prices may widen the current account deficit and impact the rupee negatively. Investors are anticipating the monetary policy decision scheduled for December 4, with rate hikes expected. The overall economic situation reveals significant inflation challenges ahead for the country.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/india-bonds-tumble-as-brent-tops-95-per-barrel-rbi-flags-food-inflation-risks/articleshow/136179562.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136179562,imgsize-190570.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/india-bonds-tumble-as-brent-tops-95-per-barrel-rbi-flags-food-inflation-risks/articleshow/136179562.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:50:12 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why is SanDisk stock falling despite surging profits?]]> </title><description><![CDATA[SanDisk shares tumble amid fading AI optimism, declining NAND price forecasts and semiconductor sector weakness. Despite strong earnings and data centre demand, investors fear potential memory-chip oversupply and weakening future profitability.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/why-is-sandisk-stock-falling-despite-surging-profits/slideshow/136179318.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136179203,imgsize-340675.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/why-is-sandisk-stock-falling-despite-surging-profits/slideshow/136179318.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:32:15 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Adani firms plan public bond sale to raise at least Rs 2,000 crore]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Adani Enterprises and Adani Power are planning public bond offerings to raise at least Rs 20 billion ($220 million), according to sources. The fundraising could help revive India's subdued public debt market, where issuances have lagged the previous fiscal year's levels. Both companies are working with local bond arrangers.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/adani-firms-plan-public-bond-sale-to-raise-at-least-220-million/articleshow/136178950.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136178950,imgsize-164718.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/adani-firms-plan-public-bond-sale-to-raise-at-least-220-million/articleshow/136178950.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:19:08 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[ITC Share Price Highlights: ITC Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/itc-stock-price-live-updates-26-nov-2026/liveblog/136178775.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136178775,imgsize-9740.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/itc-stock-price-live-updates-26-nov-2026/liveblog/136178775.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:07:02 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Adani Ent Share Price Highlights: Adani Ent. Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.